# Comments are authors that have not submitted
#
#
# Each paper will be assigned an ID known as a PID. The PID syntax in 2026 is XNNN
# where X is one of:
#     - I for invited talk
#     - C for contributed talk
#     - P for poster
#     - F for focus demo
#     - B for BoF
#     - T for tutorial
# and NNN is a three-digit number with the most-significant digit corresponding the associated Track number

#
#-Author ; PID 
# ^ These are necessary for the helper script

